"The plugin is waiting for %@ to respond. The source's server may be slow or busy." = "外掛正在等待 %@ 回應。該來源的伺服器可能較慢或忙碌。";
"The plugin file is still downloading from the subscription server." = "外掛檔案仍在從訂閱伺服器下載。";
"Other plugin requests are using every slot. This one starts as soon as one finishes." = "其他外掛請求佔用了所有位置，有一個完成後此請求就會開始。";
"This plugin is running for the first time, so its code is being converted for this device. Next time is much faster." = "這是該外掛首次執行，正在為本裝置轉換其程式碼。下次會快很多。";
"The plugin is still working. Plugins run much slower on this device than on Android." = "外掛仍在執行。外掛在本裝置上比在 Android 上慢得多。";
"%@ is responding slowly. The server may be busy or far away; you can keep waiting or try another source." = "%@ 回應緩慢。伺服器可能忙碌或距離較遠；你可以繼續等待或換一個來源。";
"Loading video details…" = "正在載入影片詳情…";
"Getting the video link for %@…" = "正在取得 %@ 的播放位址…";
"Getting the video link…" = "正在取得播放位址…";
"Loading recommendations…" = "正在載入推薦…";
"%@ · needs %@" = "%@ · 需要 %@";
"Downloading at %@" = "下載速度 %@";
"The video server" = "影片伺服器";
"%@ returned an error (%@). The link may have expired: go back and play the episode again, or choose another line." = "%@ 傳回了錯誤（%@）。連結可能已過期：請返回重新播放這一集，或選擇其他線路。";
"%@ sends %@, but this video needs about %@. Try another line, or wait without skipping." = "%@ 的速度為 %@，但此影片需要約 %@。請嘗試其他線路，或耐心等待、不要拖動進度。";
"The player is filling its buffer before playback continues." = "播放器正在緩衝，完成後將繼續播放。";
"%@/s" = "%@/秒";
"The plugin runtime is starting. This takes about half a minute after the app opens." = "外掛執行環境正在啟動。開啟 App 後大約需要半分鐘。";
"%@ hasn't delivered the first part of the video yet. The server may be slow or down; try another line." = "%@ 尚未傳來影片的第一部分。伺服器可能很慢或已停止服務；請嘗試其他線路。";
"Couldn't load video from %@ (%@). Check the connection, or choose another line." = "無法從 %@ 載入影片（%@）。請檢查網路，或選擇其他線路。";
"Couldn't get a sign-in code. Try again." = "無法取得登入 QR 碼，請重試。";
"Sign-in was approved, but the drive didn't return a login. Try again." = "已在手機上確認登入，但網盤未傳回登入資訊，請重試。";
"Open the %@ app on your phone, scan this code, and confirm the sign-in." = "在手機上開啟%@ App，掃描此 QR 碼並確認登入。";
"Open %@" = "開啟%@";
"Get New Code" = "取得新 QR 碼";
"This code has expired." = "QR 碼已過期。";
"Waiting for you to scan…" = "等待掃描…";
"Sign-in code" = "登入 QR 碼";
"Your %@ sign-in is missing or has expired. Sign in again to play this episode." = "%@網盤未登入或登入已過期，重新登入後即可播放。";
"Use Another URL" = "使用其他網址";
"The source returned a web page instead of data. It may be offline or blocking apps." = "來源回傳了網頁而不是資料，可能已失效或阻擋了應用程式存取。";
"This subscription's plugin package doesn't include %@. Ask the subscription's maintainer or use another source." = "訂閱的外掛套件中沒有 %@，請聯絡訂閱維護者或換一個來源。";
"The plugin download returned a web page instead of a plugin. Its host may be offline." = "外掛下載得到的是網頁而不是外掛，外掛所在的伺服器可能已失效。";
